sing yourself  in a new environment  the really as i've said before there i'm  not sure there is a chapter 1 chapter 10  yes  obviously if you have more repetition  it's going to be easier but at some  point you're at you're looking at this  lake or the swimming pool you just have  to get in and get wet start somewhere  start listening and reading start using  the little bit that you can immerse  yourself  and if you do those things i think  you'll be successful as a language  learner  in the meantime for more detail on the  10 secrets of language learning and  again i'm not sure i've covered all 10  but please subscribe to my 10 secrets  email course all right then thank you  for listening bye for now
 

